00:22:07.720 --> 00:22:10.850
But I do feel better now.

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:12.890
Congrats, you two.

00:22:12.890 --> 00:22:14.520
Thanks!

00:22:15.310 --> 00:22:17.890
The battle's only just begun.

00:22:17.890 --> 00:22:20.270
We're rivals from here on out.

00:22:20.650 --> 00:22:23.440
Let's all work hard at our Aikatsu.

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:24.400
Yeah!

00:23:58.750 --> 00:24:01.790
It's finally time to open Aikatsu Island.

00:24:01.790 --> 00:24:04.580
The four fresh idols chosen today

00:24:04.580 --> 00:24:08.090
will decorate the opening with their colorful dresses.

00:24:08.090 --> 00:24:09.590
Look forward to it!

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:12.680
In the refreshing fields...

00:24:12.680 --> 00:24:14.340
Is a passionate dance battle!

00:24:14.340 --> 00:24:18.060
But where did Yuzu-senpai go right before her appearance?!

00:24:18.060 --> 00:24:20.310
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.310 --> 00:24:22.230
The Midsummer Top Dancer.

00:24:22.230 --> 00:24:24.560
Become the first-star idol!
